        ll:f0e5eabe301b4780826b9e6692f6454a ;
    ll:status "proposed" ;
    ll:text "The trio evidence supports a paternal HP1-to-HP2 crossover within phase set 19256651. Eight paternal-origin child reads carry G/G across the endpoints, four on each strand. Neither parent has an eligible G/G spanning read. All eight child reads link the endpoint pattern to upstream HP1 markers, and three also link it to downstream HP2 markers. Two of those three cover both 20,968,297 and 20,968,600. The listed endpoints bound the switch at marker resolution." .

